    "source_rationale": "ADIPOQ and PLIN1 are established markers of mature adipocytes. ADIPOQ (adiponectin) is a hormone abundantly and selectively expressed by differentiated adipocytes and reflects their metabolic and endocrine function. PLIN1 (perilipin-1) is a lipid droplet\u2013associated protein essential for lipid storage and lipolysis regulation, marking cells with mature adipocyte morphology. ADIPOQ and PLIN1 reliably identify differentiated adipocytes and distinguish them from stromal and progenitor cell populations.",
